  "sourceSummary": "Muscle and Strength specifies a shoulder-width grip, controlled straight descent to the base of the sternum with chest touch, then elbow extension along the same line. Thumb-wrapped grip, quiet feet and continuous glute/upper-back support. Stopping just short of lockout is an explicit tip. The source does not prescribe a bench angle;30degrees is our implementation choice. Unracking and spotter assistance are omitted.",
